#EXTM3U
# ============================================================================
#  MY IPTV PRO — channel list (Bangla first, 150 channels)
# ============================================================================
#  Each channel points at a provider channel id with the "high://<id>" scheme.
#  The relay always builds   <UPSTREAM_BASE>/live/high/<id>.m3u8   from it
#  (see UPSTREAM_HIGH_PATH), so an auto/low/medium endpoint can never be used.
#
#  Replace the ids below with the ids from your upstream (JioTV-Go etc):
#    * either edit the "high://..." lines,
#    * or import an existing playlist:  node scripts/import-m3u.js your-list.m3u
#    * or use absolute URLs (https://cdn.example/live/high/101.m3u8) directly.
#
#  Group titles drive the panel category filter. Order = Bangla first.
# ============================================================================
